```
                        INTERNET
                            |
              ┌─────────────┴──────────────┐
              |         Web-VPC            |
              |       10.1.0.0/16          |
              |  ┌──────────────────────┐  |
              |  │  Web-Public-1a       │  |
              |  │  10.1.1.0/24         │  |
              |  │  [Web-EC2 10.1.1.91] │  |
              |  │  [Web-IGW]           │  |
              |  └──────────────────────┘  |
              └─────────────┬──────────────┘
                            |
              ┌─────────────┴──────────────┐
              |       App-VPC              |
              |      10.2.0.0/16           |
              |  ┌─────────────────────┐   |
              |  │ App-Public-1a       │   |
              |  │ 10.2.1.0/24         │   |
              |  │ [App-IGW][App-NATGW]│   |
              |  └─────────────────────┘   |
              |  ┌─────────────────────┐   |
              |  │ App-Private-1a      │   |
              |  │ 10.2.2.0/24         │   |
              |  │[App-EC2 10.2.2.206] │   |
              |  └─────────────────────┘   |
              └─────────────┬──────────────┘
                            |
  ┌─────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┐
  |                TRANSIT GATEWAY                      |
  |                Enterprise-TGW                       |
  |                                                     |
  |  TGW-RT-Web    TGW-RT-App    TGW-RT-DB             |
  |  (Web uses)    (App uses)    (DB uses)              |
  |  → App only    → Web+DB      → App only             |
  |                                                     |
  |              TGW-RT-OnPrem                          |
  |              (VPN uses)                             |
  |              → Web+App only (DB BLOCKED)            |
  └──────┬───────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┘
         |               |              |
┌────────┴───────┐  ┌────┴─────────┐  ┌┴──────────────────────┐
|    DB-VPC      |  | IPSec Tunnel |  |  OnPrem-VPC            |
|  10.3.0.0/16   |  | (Encrypted)  |  |  192.168.0.0/16        |
| ┌────────────┐ |  └──────────────┘  | ┌────────────────────┐ |
| │DB-Private  │ |                    | │OnPrem-Public-1a    │ |
| │10.3.1.0/24 │ |                    | │192.168.1.0/24      │ |
| │[DB-EC2]    │ |                    | │[StrongSwan EC2]    │ |
| └────────────┘ |                    | │[libreswan VPN GW]  │ |
└────────────────┘                    | └────────────────────┘ |
                                      └────────────────────────┘

TRAFFIC RULES:
  Web  → App:     ✅ ALLOWED (TGW-RT-Web has App route)
  App  → DB:      ✅ ALLOWED (TGW-RT-App has DB route)
  Web  → DB:      ❌ BLOCKED (TGW-RT-Web has NO DB route)
  OnPrem → Web:   ✅ ALLOWED via VPN tunnel
  OnPrem → App:   ✅ ALLOWED via VPN tunnel
  OnPrem → DB:    ❌ BLOCKED (TGW-RT-OnPrem has NO DB route)
  App  → Internet:✅ via App-NAT-GW → App-IGW
```

