## What Was Built

| Component | Name | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| VPC | Web-VPC | Internet-facing tier |
| VPC | App-VPC | Application tier |
| VPC | DB-VPC | Data tier — most restricted |
| VPC | OnPrem-VPC | Simulated on-premises data center |
| IGW | Web-IGW | Internet access for Web-VPC |
| IGW | App-IGW | Required for NAT Gateway |
| IGW | OnPrem-IGW | Internet for StrongSwan VPN |
| NAT GW | App-NAT-GW | Outbound internet for private EC2s |
| Transit Gateway | Enterprise-TGW | Central routing hub |
| TGW Attachment | TGW-Attach-Web | Connects Web-VPC to TGW |
| TGW Attachment | TGW-Attach-App | Connects App-VPC to TGW |
| TGW Attachment | TGW-Attach-DB | Connects DB-VPC to TGW |
| TGW Attachment | VPN Attachment | Connects VPN tunnel to TGW |
| TGW Route Table | TGW-RT-Web | Web → App only |
| TGW Route Table | TGW-RT-App | App → Web + DB |
| TGW Route Table | TGW-RT-DB | DB → App only |
| TGW Route Table | TGW-RT-OnPrem | OnPrem → Web + App only |
| Customer Gateway | OnPrem-CGW | Represents StrongSwan on AWS side |
| VPN Connection | OnPrem-to-AWS-VPN | IPSec VPN tunnel |
| EC2 | Web-EC2 | Web server in public subnet |
| EC2 | App-EC2 | App server in private subnet |
| EC2 | DB-EC2 | DB server in private subnet |
| EC2 | OnPrem-StrongSwan | libreswan VPN gateway |
| IAM Role | EC2-SSM-Role | SSM Session Manager access |
| VPC Endpoints x6 | SSM endpoints | SSM on private EC2s |

